window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Graphic Audio continues an Original Fantasy trilogy available in no other format!</p><p></p><p>Follow Jessica Shine, a supernatural agent turned rogue as she and her companions Ephram and Nikolai embark on a thrilling and exciting globe-trotting quest.</p><p></p><p>Jessica has magical abilities. Ephram is a former preacher turned vampire. Nikolai is a Russian with the ability to shapeshift into a monstrous creature. After being betrayed by their secret government agency, all three hit the road to stay one step ahead of their pursuers and figure out exactly what happened.</p><p></p><p>As they travel around the globe, they delve deeper into a world of mystery and secrets thousands of years old. From the famous Bone Church in Prague to the secret library of the Vatican, Jessica learns how to harness her newly discovered powers which results in a showdown against her most dangerous opponent yet- herself.</p><p></p><p>Produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p><p></p><p>Performed by Marissa Clay, Robb Moreira, RJ Bayley, Scott McCormick, Jameson Hunt, Erin Lin, Marni Penning, Torian Brackett, Holly Adams, Danny Gavigan, Bradley Foster Smith, Rob McFadyen, Christopher Walker, Zura Johnson, and Matthew Bassett.</p>"; 
